WEBVTT

01:36.200 --> 01:41.060
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.310 --> 01:43.920
[Episode 17]

02:01.150 --> 02:03.000
Where did you get this token?

02:05.120 --> 02:06.680
What did you do to my family?

02:08.710 --> 02:10.310
It doesn't matter what I did.

02:11.190 --> 02:13.190
Just think about what you should do.

02:16.400 --> 02:18.240
Now, only you can save

02:18.800 --> 02:20.030
the Xiao family.

02:23.960 --> 02:24.960
Young Master Xiao,

02:24.960 --> 02:26.760
why not give him the token now?

02:27.079 --> 02:28.810
-Give it to him. Please.
-Yeah.

02:28.880 --> 02:30.050
-Let him have it.
-Right.

02:30.050 --> 02:32.710
-Do it.
-Give it to him, will you?
-Give it to him.

02:36.079 --> 02:38.940
I really don't know
where the Hero Command Token is.

02:39.190 --> 02:40.450
It's not here, he said.

02:40.710 --> 02:42.200
Then think harder.

02:42.710 --> 02:45.710
Try to recall what happened
after you met Old Madam Wu.

02:46.120 --> 02:47.780
If you are not to die with them,

02:48.060 --> 02:49.790
then try to think of something.

03:19.710 --> 03:22.010
It's the Seven-Step Deadly Formation
of Tang Sect...

03:22.010 --> 03:24.930
Was Xiao Qiushui taken away by Tang Sect?

03:56.960 --> 03:59.030
I told you to leave this lad alone.

03:59.030 --> 03:59.590
Exactly.

03:59.590 --> 04:00.990
But none of you listened.

04:03.590 --> 04:04.320
If you ask me,

04:05.240 --> 04:06.960
I'd say let's have his limbs broken
like ours

04:06.960 --> 04:08.000
to make him spill the truth.

04:08.000 --> 04:08.840
I agree!

04:08.960 --> 04:10.000
My legs...

04:12.630 --> 04:13.430
Dear friends,

04:13.840 --> 04:15.770
even if you take all my limbs apart,

04:17.000 --> 04:19.910
your injuries simply won't heal.

04:21.390 --> 04:22.650
This is all your fault.

04:22.880 --> 04:23.720
Right now,

04:24.180 --> 04:26.040
our only option is to work as a team

04:26.580 --> 04:29.070
to find a way out of this place.

04:30.720 --> 04:31.920
My sister Xiao Xueyu

04:32.510 --> 04:33.710
is an amazing doctor.

04:34.270 --> 04:37.159
I believe she will cure all of you.

04:37.800 --> 04:38.600
Xiao Xueyu?

04:39.310 --> 04:40.159
That's great.

04:40.830 --> 04:41.600
No, no, no.

04:42.000 --> 04:43.400
Are you really that kind?

04:47.480 --> 04:48.070
Well,

04:49.120 --> 04:50.650
I'm actually not that kind.

04:51.270 --> 04:52.680
But think about this.

04:53.430 --> 04:54.510
Liu Suifeng

04:55.270 --> 04:56.480
is a ruthless man.

04:56.930 --> 04:59.360
Do you think he'll set you guys free?

04:59.960 --> 05:01.420
-No, he won't.
-No way.

05:02.850 --> 05:03.610
So,

05:04.560 --> 05:05.190
we are

05:05.920 --> 05:08.070
in the same boat now.

05:08.670 --> 05:09.800
That means we need to

05:10.310 --> 05:12.640
stand in solidarity, make joint efforts,

05:14.230 --> 05:17.390
and figure out
how to get out of this place.

05:18.240 --> 05:19.640
We're in the same boat...

05:19.680 --> 05:22.680
T-That makes us a team of five now, right?

05:23.060 --> 05:23.860
A team of five?

05:24.270 --> 05:25.070
A team of five?

05:26.040 --> 05:26.920
F-Five...

05:28.190 --> 05:28.870
Correct.

05:30.630 --> 05:31.820
We are a team of five now.

05:31.820 --> 05:33.870
W-Well, if we really make it out of here,

05:33.870 --> 05:34.730
but your sister

05:35.000 --> 05:36.680
refuses to treat our broken legs,

05:36.680 --> 05:37.740
then what can we do?

05:37.790 --> 05:39.990
-That's a possibility.
-Right!
-Yeah.

05:40.140 --> 05:41.200
That won't happen.

05:41.480 --> 05:42.310
My sister

05:42.750 --> 05:43.680
has a good heart.

05:44.030 --> 05:45.090
If you save my life,

05:45.270 --> 05:46.680
then I'll be indebted to you.

05:46.680 --> 05:48.140
Since I'm indebted to you,

05:48.370 --> 05:50.370
my family will definitely help you.

05:51.830 --> 05:52.890
I don't believe it.

05:52.920 --> 05:53.720
You're lying.

05:54.560 --> 05:56.620
Fine. You may not have trust in my sister.

05:56.620 --> 05:58.750
But you do know about Tang Sect, right?

06:00.830 --> 06:01.510
Tang Sect

06:02.000 --> 06:04.400
has a remarkable therapy for broken bones.

06:04.720 --> 06:06.430
I have a friend

06:06.680 --> 06:07.610
named Tang Fang.

06:08.470 --> 06:12.590
Although she's a bit
hot-tempered, bossy,

06:13.270 --> 06:14.800
and perhaps unreasonable,

06:14.830 --> 06:15.830
I have firm belief

06:16.230 --> 06:17.890
that if you help me out of here,

06:18.720 --> 06:20.650
she'll definitely cure all of you.

06:22.630 --> 06:23.270
-Sounds nice.
-Good.

06:23.270 --> 06:24.190
Good idea.

06:25.430 --> 06:26.490
Donglin, you do it.

06:26.560 --> 06:26.950
Me?

06:27.190 --> 06:27.560
I...

06:27.560 --> 06:28.560
Donglin, you're huge.

06:28.560 --> 06:29.490
Go break it open.

06:29.560 --> 06:30.950
Just do it. I don't have any tools.

06:30.950 --> 06:32.750
-Okay.
-Hurry. I can't move my legs.

06:32.750 --> 06:33.560
Hurry!

06:35.340 --> 06:36.670
Here comes Liu Suifeng!

06:48.950 --> 06:49.750
Xiao Qiushui,

06:50.920 --> 06:52.250
what on earth happened?

06:52.720 --> 06:53.980
Didn't you already...

06:58.310 --> 07:00.640
I had to make a snap judgement
at that time.

07:01.830 --> 07:03.830
This is quite a complicated matter.

07:05.870 --> 07:08.270
I'll explain everything to you
in due time.

07:09.750 --> 07:11.280
How dare you lie to me again?

07:12.190 --> 07:15.050
Nobody in the martial world
has the guts to lie to me.

07:15.070 --> 07:17.870
You even locked me up in an iron cage.
How could you?

07:20.750 --> 07:21.430
You must be

07:21.630 --> 07:24.360
the kind-hearted sister
he told us about, right?

07:24.600 --> 07:25.270
She must be!

07:25.270 --> 07:27.330
She's obviously the bossy Miss Tang!

07:27.450 --> 07:28.160
Shut up!

07:29.920 --> 07:31.070
M-Miss Tang?

07:37.920 --> 07:39.180
I'll give you a chance.

07:39.880 --> 07:40.610
Explain now.

07:45.390 --> 07:47.520
I can't put my friends in danger again.

07:47.750 --> 07:49.550
If something bad happens to you,

07:49.680 --> 07:52.480
I'll be utterly guilty about Rou
till the day I die.

08:01.800 --> 08:03.730
You can talk when we're out of here.

08:04.190 --> 08:05.430
T-That's right.

08:06.160 --> 08:07.960
When Liu Suifeng comes here again,

08:07.960 --> 08:08.560
Miss Tang,

08:08.590 --> 08:10.110
you'll suffer like us.

08:10.390 --> 08:11.310
Exactly.

08:14.810 --> 08:17.390
Liu Suifeng? You met Liu Suifeng?

08:18.000 --> 08:18.560
Yes, we did.

08:18.560 --> 08:19.510
Look at my leg.

08:19.510 --> 08:20.970
-And my arm.
-He maimed us.

08:23.060 --> 08:23.860
That's right.

08:25.120 --> 08:26.520
Feng Lang is Liu Suifeng.

08:33.090 --> 08:34.890
The target isn't here. Retreat.

08:39.850 --> 08:41.650
When we were fighting the enemy,

08:42.630 --> 08:43.890
I was indeed confused.

08:44.440 --> 08:46.150
Song Mingzhu has great martial skills.

08:46.150 --> 08:48.280
She shouldn't have feared him so much.

08:48.440 --> 08:50.840
But if he really is Liu Suifeng,

08:51.320 --> 08:52.850
then that would make sense.

08:53.240 --> 08:55.590
Besides, the setting here...

08:56.360 --> 08:58.200
How is he related to Tang Sect?

09:01.160 --> 09:04.000
We're pressed for time now.

09:04.600 --> 09:06.200
Let's resume the conversation
after we escape.

09:06.200 --> 09:07.960
-Right.
-Yeah. Get out of here first.

09:07.960 --> 09:09.160
Let's get out of here.

09:09.480 --> 09:11.810
Half of the traps here have been disabled.

09:11.870 --> 09:14.480
The four of you, protect him.

09:14.870 --> 09:15.960
If you help Mr. Xiao out,

09:15.960 --> 09:17.460
I'll treat you
with the medicine exclusive to Tang Sect.

09:17.460 --> 09:18.100
Terrific!

09:18.910 --> 09:19.510
Miss Tang...

09:19.510 --> 09:21.720
-Deal!
-It's a pact now, Miss Tang.

09:38.270 --> 09:38.840
Master.

09:39.360 --> 09:41.160
Your formation has been broken.

09:41.780 --> 09:43.820
Someone rescued Xiao Qiushui.

09:44.480 --> 09:47.140
This person not only solved
this intricate formation of Tang Sect,

09:47.140 --> 09:48.740
but also saved Xiao Qiushui.

09:49.720 --> 09:50.630
Could it be her?

09:53.600 --> 09:54.240
Fang,

09:54.670 --> 09:55.320
is he

09:55.630 --> 09:57.290
really that important to you?

10:04.080 --> 10:04.600
Go!

10:09.380 --> 10:10.060
Donglin!

10:18.360 --> 10:19.040
Step aside.

10:24.590 --> 10:26.510
The poison has been eroding
your meridians for too long.

10:26.510 --> 10:28.460
I'm afraid even its antidote can't help.

10:28.460 --> 10:29.070
Eat this.

10:32.200 --> 10:32.800
Thank you.

10:39.440 --> 10:40.630
For that potent poison,

10:40.630 --> 10:42.830
I gave a pill that absorbs ants' toxins.

10:43.150 --> 10:45.270
Now, you'll have to rely on yourself.

10:57.440 --> 10:59.420
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

10:59.450 --> 11:01.950
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

11:01.970 --> 11:05.570
♪ Let the gleam of swords
cut through all dust ♪

11:05.770 --> 11:07.720
♪ Strive for the far shore
at journey's end ♪

11:07.750 --> 11:09.760
♪ Only when the long night
finally comes to an end ♪

11:09.790 --> 11:12.820
♪ Will this bow be not in vain ♪

11:12.950 --> 11:15.060
♪ Let the pouring rain drench me ♪

11:15.090 --> 11:16.800
♪ Let frost and snow embrace me too ♪

11:16.830 --> 11:20.300
♪ My lifelong sword intent
remains unchanged ♪

11:20.330 --> 11:22.050
♪ Through 1,000 years, a million ages ♪

11:22.080 --> 11:24.050
♪ I will still cleave mountains
and carve paths ♪

11:24.080 --> 11:30.980
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

11:39.960 --> 11:42.660
♪ Thousands of turbid waves ♪

11:43.780 --> 11:45.560
♪ Tread on through till the break of day ♪

11:45.690 --> 11:48.290
♪ I'm ready to go with you ♪

11:48.450 --> 11:50.700
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

11:50.720 --> 11:52.640
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

11:52.670 --> 11:55.890
♪ Let the gleam of swords
cut through all dust ♪

11:55.920 --> 11:57.640
♪ Through 1,000 years, a million ages ♪

11:57.670 --> 11:59.650
♪ I will still cleave mountains
and carve paths ♪

11:59.670 --> 12:06.570
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

12:08.150 --> 12:08.750
Thank you.

12:10.430 --> 12:11.120
Miss Tang,

12:11.630 --> 12:12.870
I've noticed you're just

12:12.870 --> 12:13.750
as an incredible healer

12:13.750 --> 12:15.810
as that gentle and caring Xiao Xueyu.

12:15.910 --> 12:16.510
Right!

12:18.790 --> 12:20.270
You also know Xiao Xueyu?

12:21.030 --> 12:22.120
Not really.

12:23.080 --> 12:23.840
We heard about her from him.

12:23.840 --> 12:24.600
He told us about her.

12:24.600 --> 12:25.930
Yes, exactly.

12:26.550 --> 12:28.750
He said you're difficult, bossy,

12:28.960 --> 12:30.720
-and unreasonable.
-That's right.

12:30.720 --> 12:32.550
Will you treat us

12:32.870 --> 12:35.440
without us begging you?

12:35.440 --> 12:36.320
Will you?

12:38.750 --> 12:40.210
Is that what you told them?

12:41.270 --> 12:42.600
Stop talking nonsense,

12:42.990 --> 12:44.590
or I'll break all your limbs.

12:49.030 --> 12:50.430
I didn't mean any of that.

12:51.650 --> 12:52.250
Boring.

13:02.530 --> 13:03.750
Have it back. You're its owner.

13:03.750 --> 13:05.610
Keep your own stuff for yourself.

13:23.510 --> 13:24.360
Qiushui,

13:24.800 --> 13:26.530
I have one more favor to ask.

13:35.150 --> 13:37.080
This is called the Golden Swallow.

13:38.200 --> 13:40.060
An old friend of mine left it to me.

13:43.320 --> 13:46.630
He was known as the best

13:47.240 --> 13:50.500
and the most feared fighter
in the martial world years ago—

13:53.250 --> 13:54.050
Crazy Yan.

13:57.120 --> 13:59.720
He was once a disciple of Elder Wubei's,

14:00.480 --> 14:03.080
and the sole inheritor
of the Voidheart Codex.

14:03.670 --> 14:05.800
Out of jealousy, his fellow disciples

14:05.800 --> 14:08.250
kidnapped his younger brother and sister

14:09.150 --> 14:11.960
to coerce him
into surrendering the Voidheart Codex.

14:11.960 --> 14:13.790
But after Mr. Yan gave them the book,

14:13.790 --> 14:15.630
those people ate their words.

14:15.910 --> 14:18.080
As a result, Mr. Yan spent 10 years

14:18.270 --> 14:21.390
searching desperately for his siblings.

14:22.480 --> 14:23.960
Just when he found a lead,

14:24.720 --> 14:26.550
the Northern Wastelanders happened to

14:26.550 --> 14:30.150
have sent masters from beyond the borders
to assassinate my son.

14:30.440 --> 14:32.870
Mr. Yan put his frantic search on hold

14:33.120 --> 14:35.360
and rushed to save my son's life.

14:38.510 --> 14:41.960
Again, he lost the trail
of his brother and sister.

14:45.150 --> 14:49.120
People all say Crazy Yan looked down on
everyone in the martial world

14:49.900 --> 14:51.160
with utter impudence.

14:52.030 --> 14:53.320
But surprisingly,

14:54.220 --> 14:56.280
he actually had a chivalrous nature.

14:57.270 --> 14:58.080
Later on,

14:58.630 --> 15:00.600
Mr. Yan continued his search
at his maximum capacity,

15:00.600 --> 15:02.730
only to find his younger brother dead.

15:03.870 --> 15:07.000
He slaughtered many a sect
when he hunted for the killer.

15:07.120 --> 15:09.240
Being one step away from total madness,

15:09.240 --> 15:12.200
he became Crazy Yan,
who was dreaded by everyone.

15:15.150 --> 15:17.750
His obsession
with finding his younger sister

15:17.790 --> 15:22.200
drove him to turn the martial world
into a complete chaos.

15:22.720 --> 15:25.780
That was why he was finally besieged
on Wuxing Mountain

15:25.960 --> 15:27.690
and knocked off Nantian Abyss.

15:28.720 --> 15:30.000
Despite all that,

15:31.150 --> 15:35.440
Mr. Yan did do my family a big favor
and show great dedication to the country.

15:35.790 --> 15:39.550
The Wu family is indebted to him.

15:41.600 --> 15:42.360
In the end,

15:43.630 --> 15:46.270
he left nothing
but this Gold Swallow in haste.

15:49.200 --> 15:50.460
What about his sister?

15:52.150 --> 15:53.320
Over these years,

15:54.910 --> 15:57.770
I've been looking everywhere
for Mr. Yan's sister.

15:58.320 --> 15:59.120
But I'm afraid

16:00.390 --> 16:02.190
it'll take a long time to find her

16:02.440 --> 16:03.970
in this vast martial world.

16:04.240 --> 16:05.750
I'm already old.

16:06.630 --> 16:11.030
So, I'd like to entrust you
with this Golden Swallow as a keepsake,

16:11.550 --> 16:13.120
and the task of finding

16:13.790 --> 16:16.790
Mr. Yan's only surviving family member.

16:29.200 --> 16:30.030
Old Madam Wu,

16:30.960 --> 16:32.910
I will do my utmost to find her.

16:46.390 --> 16:47.960
Miss Tang...

16:48.600 --> 16:50.790
Miss Tang, sorry to interrupt you.

16:51.670 --> 16:52.360
Miss Tang!

16:53.590 --> 16:56.070
Miss Tang... Miss Tang...

16:56.910 --> 16:57.790
Miss Tang!

17:03.630 --> 17:05.480
This is the Bone Repairing Salve.

17:05.480 --> 17:07.130
Apply it evenly on the joints.

17:07.130 --> 17:10.260
Then your broken limbs
will be able to move temporarily.

17:11.310 --> 17:11.920
However,

17:12.550 --> 17:14.480
you still need a skilled physician

17:14.589 --> 17:16.250
to fix your injuries for good.

17:16.770 --> 17:17.329
Besides,

17:17.640 --> 17:20.270
this is the Jade Recovery Powder.

17:20.960 --> 17:21.640
Take it,

17:21.829 --> 17:25.089
and the seal on your internal energy
will be lifted in time.

17:27.450 --> 17:28.310
Stop fighting for them!

17:28.310 --> 17:30.400
-My leg!
-Give me a bottle!
-You're on my leg!

17:30.400 --> 17:31.800
-Stop fighting.
-Get up!

17:34.110 --> 17:34.790
Give me a bottle.

17:34.790 --> 17:35.550
Qiushui,

17:36.590 --> 17:38.160
what exactly happened?

17:39.070 --> 17:39.870
How did you...

17:43.680 --> 17:45.010
come back from the dead?

17:45.590 --> 17:47.270
G-Give it to m-me...

17:48.030 --> 17:49.830
Perhaps that hit from Qu Hanshan

17:51.030 --> 17:53.290
put me in a state of suspended animation.

17:53.680 --> 17:54.350
It hurts!

17:54.450 --> 17:56.040
That made me look dead.

17:57.000 --> 17:57.750
Here, here.

18:01.830 --> 18:03.490
-It's too much.
-This will do.

18:04.510 --> 18:05.240
Give it to me.

18:05.550 --> 18:07.010
I'm just glad you're fine.

18:08.160 --> 18:08.890
No grabbing!

18:11.830 --> 18:13.350
What will you do next?

18:13.960 --> 18:14.750
Let me do it.

18:16.030 --> 18:17.590
Yes, right here.

18:18.030 --> 18:20.680
-Let me do it. You don't know how.
-Not so hard!

18:21.720 --> 18:23.110
About the Sword King and Liu Suifeng...

18:23.110 --> 18:23.770
Let me help.

18:24.160 --> 18:26.420
I did my best to hold them off previously.

18:26.650 --> 18:29.970
Now, I must head back to Huanhua Sect
as soon as possible.

18:30.310 --> 18:31.880
I hope Yiren has arrived.

18:32.310 --> 18:34.770
-Give it to me!
-Let me have it!
-Look at that!

18:35.960 --> 18:38.820
We'll set out
when they're done applying the salve.

18:41.400 --> 18:41.960
Okay.

18:58.310 --> 18:58.790
Xueyu!

18:59.070 --> 18:59.590
Xueyu!

18:59.590 --> 19:00.270
What's wrong?

19:00.270 --> 19:01.000
Are you okay?

19:01.750 --> 19:03.680
I'm fine. It's an urgent trip.

19:04.070 --> 19:04.920
Let's keep going.

19:04.920 --> 19:05.720
Young Master!

19:07.030 --> 19:07.830
Young Master,

19:07.920 --> 19:09.030
Second Young Master and Mr. Zuoqiu

19:09.030 --> 19:10.350
are still nowhere to be found.

19:10.350 --> 19:11.150
Young Master!

19:12.040 --> 19:12.790
Young Master,

19:12.790 --> 19:13.720
good news.

19:13.720 --> 19:15.550
Third Young Master is still alive.

19:15.550 --> 19:16.750
What did you just say?

19:17.000 --> 19:18.030
Did someone tell you that,

19:18.030 --> 19:19.090
or did you see it yourself?

19:19.090 --> 19:21.310
I was told that Third Young Master
had been seen alive.

19:21.310 --> 19:23.270
So, I carefully inquired about him
along the way.

19:23.270 --> 19:25.270
Someone did see Third Young Master.

19:25.680 --> 19:26.610
What a blessing!

19:26.750 --> 19:28.080
Qiushui is still alive.

19:28.680 --> 19:29.350
Great.

19:30.790 --> 19:31.450
Qiushui...

19:33.550 --> 19:36.610
would probably rush back
to the Sword Manor right away.

19:37.590 --> 19:38.650
-Xueyu.
-Yiren...

19:41.580 --> 19:44.010
-Xueyu!
-Xueyue!

19:44.870 --> 19:45.500
Xueyu!

19:50.510 --> 19:51.510
It's snake venom.

19:52.510 --> 19:53.640
How did this happen?

19:53.790 --> 19:55.790
Xueyu was so eager
to return to the Sword Manor

19:55.790 --> 19:57.480
that she chose to keep her injury secret.

19:57.480 --> 19:58.640
If she hurries on with the journey,

19:58.640 --> 19:59.590
she might die.

20:00.230 --> 20:01.760
But now, the Sword Manor...

20:01.920 --> 20:03.650
I'll stay and try to help Xueyu.

20:04.000 --> 20:04.510
Yiren,

20:04.750 --> 20:07.160
your priority is to go back
to the Sword Manor

20:07.160 --> 20:08.360
to save your parents.

20:10.110 --> 20:11.040
You two stay put.

20:11.350 --> 20:12.510
The rest will leave with me.

20:12.510 --> 20:13.170
-Yes!
-Yes!

20:29.000 --> 20:30.400
My leg is healed!

20:30.590 --> 20:31.590
My arm is healed!

20:31.830 --> 20:32.830
My leg is fine now!

20:36.200 --> 20:37.130
A full recovery!

20:38.000 --> 20:40.200
-How wonderful.
-All is fine now.
-My leg is fixed!

20:40.200 --> 20:41.110
Thank you, Miss Tang.

20:41.110 --> 20:43.270
-Thank you, Miss Tang.
-Many thanks, Miss Tang.

20:43.270 --> 20:43.960
Thank you.

20:45.030 --> 20:45.940
Why did you hit me?

20:45.940 --> 20:47.270
I lost control of my arm!

20:49.750 --> 20:51.480
You guys were in a mess just now.

20:51.550 --> 20:53.110
Did you not the apply the salve evenly,

20:53.110 --> 20:54.400
so your meridians went out of order?

20:54.400 --> 20:55.470
-Donglin!
-I...

20:55.550 --> 20:56.790
I told you not to rush!

20:56.790 --> 20:57.720
Why did you have to fight over the salve?

20:57.720 --> 20:59.450
What did that have to do with me?

21:27.680 --> 21:28.510
Liu Suifeng,

21:29.270 --> 21:31.070
you just can't stop hounding me.

21:32.000 --> 21:32.730
Liu Suifeng,

21:33.660 --> 21:35.680
you know about
the formations of Tang Sect.

21:35.680 --> 21:37.920
How are you related to Tang Sect?

21:38.790 --> 21:39.880
Back off, Fang.

21:44.550 --> 21:45.640
You can't stop me.

21:47.450 --> 21:48.580
You called me Fang?

21:49.830 --> 21:51.690
I'm Feng, your childhood friend.

22:14.520 --> 22:15.720
Feng, run!

22:15.750 --> 22:16.480
Little brat,

22:16.480 --> 22:18.540
how dare you set free the boy I picked!

22:21.830 --> 22:23.310
-Fang!
-Feng!

22:32.470 --> 22:33.680
You really are Feng?

22:35.400 --> 22:38.510
I meant to reunite with you
in a better way.

22:40.790 --> 22:42.190
So you're from Tang Sect.

22:45.030 --> 22:46.430
As my bosom friend, Feng,

22:46.720 --> 22:49.000
why would you help the Power Gang do evil,

22:49.590 --> 22:52.480
and constantly fight against
the Xiao family?

22:53.270 --> 22:54.600
Do you remember how I was

22:55.060 --> 22:56.790
taken in by Tang Sect years ago?

23:01.070 --> 23:04.130
Tang Yaoshun impregnated my mother.
Then, they had me.

23:05.240 --> 23:08.030
Afterwards, he went back to Tang Sect
as its master,

23:08.030 --> 23:09.200
while my mother and I

23:09.400 --> 23:11.130
stayed alone in Baicao Valley.

23:11.160 --> 23:12.760
However, that vile creature

23:13.440 --> 23:15.770
Xiao Xilou led many from the martial world

23:15.850 --> 23:19.520
to raid and butcher Baicao Valley.

23:27.550 --> 23:29.270
I had a narrow escape from that disaster.

23:29.270 --> 23:31.680
I meant to ask Old Madam Tang
to help me seek revenge,

23:31.680 --> 23:33.110
but she just ignored me.

23:34.310 --> 23:35.510
From my perspective,

23:35.590 --> 23:37.450
back then, Baicao Valley made...

23:38.160 --> 23:39.960
B-Baicao Valley made the Marching Pills

23:39.960 --> 23:40.810
for those invaders

23:40.810 --> 23:42.270
from the Northern Wasteland.

23:42.270 --> 23:44.070
Thanks to Mr. Xiao Qiushui's father

23:44.070 --> 23:46.630
and other righteous martial practitioners,
that place was finally flattened.

23:46.630 --> 23:48.460
The people there deserved it!

23:48.480 --> 23:50.970
-Yes. They deserved it!
-They did!
-Yeah!

23:51.360 --> 23:54.790
-They got their just deserts!
-They did!
-Right!

23:54.810 --> 23:55.570
Nonsense!

23:59.900 --> 24:03.030
Baicao Valley always
stood aloof from worldly affairs.

24:03.310 --> 24:06.170
How could we have possibly
colluded with the enemy?

24:08.750 --> 24:10.880
It was that schemer Xiao Xilou's fault.

24:10.880 --> 24:12.510
His greed for our pills and elixirs

24:12.510 --> 24:13.750
compelled him

24:13.750 --> 24:16.350
to frame Baicao Valley
and commit atrocities.

24:20.000 --> 24:22.260
My father would never harm the innocent.

24:22.480 --> 24:24.010
You're talking gibberish.

24:24.180 --> 24:25.380
I witnessed

24:25.660 --> 24:27.390
their brutality and violence.

24:29.880 --> 24:30.510
Fang,

24:31.110 --> 24:32.950
now that you've learned the truth,

24:32.950 --> 24:34.550
you shouldn't try to stop me.

24:34.790 --> 24:35.850
Don't call me Fang.

24:37.600 --> 24:38.350
You're no longer

24:38.350 --> 24:40.070
the Feng I knew in childhood.

24:40.380 --> 24:41.570
Now, in my eyes,

24:42.070 --> 24:43.550
you're just the overbearing

24:43.550 --> 24:45.280
deputy chief of the Power Gang,

24:45.880 --> 24:46.790
Liu Suifeng.

24:47.720 --> 24:50.590
I joined the Power Gang
by a strange quirk of fate.

24:50.860 --> 24:52.590
I'll tell you the details later.

24:52.590 --> 24:53.390
But right now,

24:54.030 --> 24:55.830
I must get the Hero Command Token

24:55.880 --> 24:57.540
and find the Voidheart Codex.

24:59.160 --> 24:59.750
Fang,

25:00.000 --> 25:01.720
I know you have your missions too.

25:01.720 --> 25:02.850
When I get the codex,

25:03.240 --> 25:04.970
I'll definitely lend it to you.

25:05.030 --> 25:07.030
Why do you have to stick with this man

25:07.310 --> 25:08.840
and put yourself in danger?

25:11.880 --> 25:13.140
I don't need your help.

25:14.160 --> 25:15.760
I did come here for the codex,

25:16.350 --> 25:18.210
but I care about other things too.

25:18.680 --> 25:21.480
I'm deeply aware of what can be done

25:21.590 --> 25:22.960
and what cannot be done

25:23.550 --> 25:25.110
in the martial world.

25:25.750 --> 25:26.950
I quest for what I want

25:27.160 --> 25:28.680
in an honest and fair way.

25:29.590 --> 25:31.950
I didn't rescue you from hell years ago

25:33.230 --> 25:34.430
only to let you

25:34.670 --> 25:36.190
drag others into hell.

25:42.070 --> 25:42.720
Fang,

25:45.360 --> 25:46.620
you can't make me stop.

25:58.270 --> 25:59.270
Deputy Chief Liu,

25:59.790 --> 26:02.230
isn't it against
the ethics of the martial world

26:02.230 --> 26:05.360
to attack someone
who has lost all his martial strength?

26:09.250 --> 26:10.100
Well said!

26:19.200 --> 26:21.020
[Prince Liang of Daxi, Glow Achiever]
[Liang Dou]

26:26.740 --> 26:28.670
I've led a troop to this very place.

26:28.900 --> 26:31.230
Liu Suifeng, you'd better tread lightly.

26:34.310 --> 26:35.170
Your Highness,

26:37.270 --> 26:39.030
why not go be a carefree prince

26:39.990 --> 26:42.850
and stay out of this mess
involving the Xiao family?

26:44.260 --> 26:46.460
Xilou and his wife are my close friends.

26:46.580 --> 26:47.640
Even catastrophes

26:49.000 --> 26:50.860
can't deter me from helping them,

26:50.860 --> 26:52.390
let alone this little mess.

26:55.920 --> 26:56.590
What now?

26:57.590 --> 26:59.190
Why don't you leave already?

26:59.640 --> 27:01.240
Do you fancy a fight with us?

27:03.510 --> 27:05.110
May our paths never cross again

27:05.110 --> 27:06.640
in this vast martial world.

27:14.840 --> 27:15.970
Oh, right. Qiushui,

27:16.070 --> 27:17.330
how are your injuries?

27:18.240 --> 27:19.830
I'm much better now.

27:22.830 --> 27:25.290
Your Highness,
thank you for saving my life.

27:26.960 --> 27:27.830
Now, I'm afraid

27:28.240 --> 27:30.970
Xiao's Sword Manor won't hold up
for much longer.

27:31.350 --> 27:33.830
Your Highness, please lend me some horses,

27:34.560 --> 27:35.690
so I can go back soon.

27:35.980 --> 27:36.980
Consider it done.

27:37.550 --> 27:39.510
I've prepared several fast horses for you.

27:39.510 --> 27:40.710
They can be your ride.

27:40.750 --> 27:41.750
I heard the sect leaders

27:41.750 --> 27:43.270
of Shaolin and Wudang had set out.

27:43.270 --> 27:44.590
You're severely injured now.

27:44.590 --> 27:45.990
Let me go meet them first.

27:47.440 --> 27:48.840
Your Highness, I promise

27:48.860 --> 27:51.490
to repay the generous help
you offered today.

28:10.670 --> 28:11.360
Chief.

28:12.640 --> 28:13.360
Suifeng,

28:15.440 --> 28:17.240
where is the Hero Command Token?

28:19.960 --> 28:21.420
Forgive my incompetence.

28:21.720 --> 28:23.120
I failed to get the token.

28:26.000 --> 28:27.800
You've always been meticulous.

28:28.640 --> 28:30.500
Why did you keep failing the tasks

28:31.200 --> 28:32.730
involving the Xiao family?

28:34.350 --> 28:35.610
I tried my best, Chief.

28:36.160 --> 28:39.490
You've shown absolute loyalty
to the gang over these years.

28:39.670 --> 28:42.200
But now,
you've had several failures in a row.

28:42.350 --> 28:44.010
Even if I keep silent about it,

28:44.440 --> 28:46.770
how will you command respect from others?

28:48.070 --> 28:50.670
I swear I will bring back
the Hero Command Token

28:50.790 --> 28:52.650
to convince everyone in the gang.

28:54.440 --> 28:56.640
Tang Sect, Shaolin Sect and Wudang Sect

28:56.680 --> 29:00.610
have stayed cleared of the affairs
of the martial world for a long time,

29:00.640 --> 29:04.840
yet they're now unanimously intervening
with these matters about the Xiao family.

29:04.840 --> 29:06.500
Shaolin Sect and Wudang Sect?

29:06.920 --> 29:08.510
The intelligence I just received says

29:08.510 --> 29:12.070
the sect leaders of Shaolin and Wudang
have rushed to the Xiao Residence.

29:12.070 --> 29:13.240
Go stop them.

29:14.200 --> 29:15.460
Get them out of the way.

29:18.850 --> 29:19.480
Got it.

29:27.060 --> 29:29.380
[Wave-Listening Pavilion]

29:31.240 --> 29:31.830
Master,

29:32.070 --> 29:34.290
if we fight Shaolin Sect and Wudang Sect
at the same time,

29:34.290 --> 29:35.290
there might be...

29:42.230 --> 29:43.030
Might be what?

29:44.490 --> 29:45.290
Deputy Chief,

29:46.160 --> 29:47.880
Tianzheng has mighty strength.

29:47.880 --> 29:50.310
His internal energy alone
can penetrate everything.

29:50.310 --> 29:52.310
On the other hand, Taichan's sword skills

29:52.310 --> 29:53.350
are flexible, variable,

29:53.350 --> 29:54.640
and unfathomable.

29:57.970 --> 29:59.230
[Fist Demon, Sheng Jiangbei]
[Flying-Dagger Demon, Sun Rentu]

30:01.030 --> 30:02.430
If those two join forces,

30:02.440 --> 30:04.500
they can make a perfect duo in combat.

30:05.310 --> 30:07.910
I'm afraid
we'll have a slim chance of victory.

30:08.740 --> 30:10.070
It's the chief's order.

30:11.270 --> 30:12.720
Even if we have to die,

30:13.690 --> 30:15.040
what's there to regret?

30:16.510 --> 30:17.070
Yes.

30:20.480 --> 30:21.070
Yes.

30:23.990 --> 30:24.710
That said,

30:26.220 --> 30:29.150
it's no doubt
that confronting these two major sects

30:29.790 --> 30:31.390
will put ourselves in peril.

30:32.270 --> 30:34.530
I won't let your lives be ended so easily.

30:37.830 --> 30:40.750
When fighting those martial sects
of the Central Plain,

30:40.750 --> 30:42.480
I'll make the best use of my wit.

30:43.590 --> 30:45.340
Master, you're a marvelous strategist.

30:45.340 --> 30:46.880
We await your instructions.

30:46.880 --> 30:48.940
The spies planted in the martial sects

30:48.940 --> 30:51.540
of the Central Plain
by the Power Gang years ago

30:52.600 --> 30:55.600
are finally coming in handy.

31:22.640 --> 31:23.820
Junior, calm down.

31:35.620 --> 31:37.100
[Leader of Hengshan Sect, White Guanyin]
[Mo Yanxia]

31:37.690 --> 31:39.860
It's Mo Yanxia, White Guanyin?

31:40.920 --> 31:42.980
Many thanks for your help, Leader Mo.

31:43.830 --> 31:45.400
Hengshan Sect sees it as its duty

31:45.400 --> 31:47.530
to purge the martial world of the evil.

31:48.310 --> 31:48.880
Good!

31:49.440 --> 31:51.720
Now that you're inviting trouble
and having a death wish,

31:51.720 --> 31:53.630
don't blame us for showing you no mercy.

31:53.630 --> 31:54.880
The sea of suffering is boundless.

31:54.880 --> 31:55.940
Where is the shore?

31:56.090 --> 31:57.690
It's better to avoid killing

31:58.030 --> 31:59.720
wherever conditions permit.

32:21.770 --> 32:24.920
[Leader of Shaolin Sect]
[Tianzheng]

32:22.430 --> 32:24.320
Amitabha.

32:31.160 --> 32:31.990
Master.

32:32.680 --> 32:34.310
Master Tianzheng's Finger of Vicissitudes

32:34.310 --> 32:36.170
truly lives up to its reputation.

32:40.960 --> 32:43.710
You have committed grave sins

32:44.160 --> 32:45.510
by taking so many lives.

32:46.180 --> 32:47.840
Put down your weapons already

32:48.240 --> 32:50.240
and repent for your evil deeds.

32:50.640 --> 32:51.400
Old monk,

32:51.880 --> 32:54.210
why don't you just mind your own business?

32:55.640 --> 32:58.920
Will Shaolin Sect stay out of this matter

32:59.510 --> 33:00.720
if I give you this?

33:01.600 --> 33:03.280
[Shaolin Sect, Baoxiang]
[Shaolin Sect, Longhu]

33:01.750 --> 33:02.880
It's the Mind Sutra.

33:04.240 --> 33:05.040
That's right.

33:05.470 --> 33:07.830
This is the Mind Sutra
written by Damo himself—

33:07.830 --> 33:09.750
a priceless treasure in Buddhism.

33:09.750 --> 33:11.920
We'd like to gift it to Shaolin Sect.

33:12.400 --> 33:14.400
It would be a huge shame for all Buddhists

33:14.400 --> 33:17.030
if such a precious item
went missing again.

33:18.920 --> 33:21.780
This sutra is indeed highly valuable
for Buddhism.

33:22.160 --> 33:26.160
But upholding justice for the Xiao family
takes precedence over it.

33:28.030 --> 33:28.920
In that case,

33:30.200 --> 33:31.400
I'll destroy it then.

33:46.800 --> 33:47.960
Still intact.

33:48.820 --> 33:51.950
You obviously can't bring yourself
to see it get ruined.

34:01.390 --> 34:03.250
This is the authentic Mind Sutra.

34:04.330 --> 34:06.240
Though to plot against me,

34:06.270 --> 34:08.190
you hid poisonous bugs in it,

34:09.630 --> 34:12.040
it'd still be a pity
to let it go to rack and ruin.

34:12.040 --> 34:13.830
So you did figure out its secret.

34:13.830 --> 34:14.920
[Mind Sutra]

34:18.760 --> 34:20.489
What powerful poisonous bugs.

34:20.590 --> 34:21.840
It takes some energy

34:22.030 --> 34:23.550
to kill them.

34:44.190 --> 34:44.920
Red Phoenix.

34:45.320 --> 34:45.920
Master!

34:47.030 --> 34:49.830
-Master!
-Master Tianzheng!
-Master Tianzheng!

34:54.989 --> 34:56.790
It seems I'm still one step late.

34:59.160 --> 35:01.360
Your Finger of Vicissitudes
is impressive, old monk.

35:01.360 --> 35:03.560
But I've finally managed to injure you.

35:04.770 --> 35:05.720
I put all my strength

35:05.720 --> 35:07.470
into that strike I threw at you.

35:07.830 --> 35:09.290
Old monk, that was too much

35:10.510 --> 35:11.700
even for you, right?

35:15.360 --> 35:17.190
Amitabha.

35:17.270 --> 35:17.840
Master,

35:18.070 --> 35:19.670
I'm going to kill all of them!

35:20.400 --> 35:21.600
-Junior!
-Baoxiang.

35:22.380 --> 35:23.880
The qi in you is overwhelming.

35:23.880 --> 35:25.590
To avoid going to the extreme,

35:25.840 --> 35:27.400
you must not fight again.

35:27.670 --> 35:28.710
Yes, Master.

35:32.710 --> 35:34.800
Master Tianzheng is highly revered
in the martial world.

35:34.800 --> 35:36.710
You're trying to kill him
in broad daylight.

35:36.710 --> 35:37.840
Don't you fear Shaolin Sect

35:37.840 --> 35:40.000
will see the Power Gang
as its mortal enemy?

35:40.000 --> 35:40.600
Fear?

35:41.400 --> 35:44.070
I think it will be Shaolin, Wudang, and Emei Sects

35:44.070 --> 35:46.070
that fear making an enemy
of the Power Gang.

35:46.070 --> 35:47.130
Are you attempting

35:47.710 --> 35:50.570
to plunge the entire Daxi martial world
into chaos?

35:50.630 --> 35:51.890
Then let's have a match

35:52.250 --> 35:55.050
and find out who has the reign
of the martial world.

35:56.140 --> 35:58.340
You think we're intimidated by you lot?

36:03.280 --> 36:03.880
Kill them!

36:25.520 --> 36:26.860
[Master Taichan]
[Leader of Wudang Sect]

36:28.110 --> 36:29.550
Taichan, there you are.

36:30.190 --> 36:31.880
How very nice.

36:36.670 --> 36:37.360
Tianzheng,

36:38.440 --> 36:39.920
look at you, being reduced to such a state

36:39.920 --> 36:41.450
by these younger fighters.

36:41.840 --> 36:44.170
You don't seem to have made much progress.

36:46.200 --> 36:46.990
Tianzheng,

36:47.400 --> 36:48.330
you're injured.

36:48.400 --> 36:49.460
I'll help you heal.

36:49.630 --> 36:51.030
When your condition gets better,

36:51.030 --> 36:52.110
we'll join forces.

36:52.740 --> 36:56.000
This young crowd from the Power Gang
can't be a threat to us.

36:57.630 --> 36:59.230
Amitabha.

36:59.670 --> 37:02.110
Master Tianzheng's internal injuries
seem severe.

37:02.110 --> 37:04.070
How can he stabilize his condition
right here?

37:04.070 --> 37:04.880
Tianzheng is able to do it,

37:04.880 --> 37:06.140
though others may not.

37:06.510 --> 37:08.630
His Finger of Vicissitudes not only kills

37:08.630 --> 37:09.590
those who touch it,

37:09.590 --> 37:10.920
but also heals injuries

37:11.070 --> 37:12.550
and revives the dead if used properly.

37:12.550 --> 37:14.360
Tianzheng, I'll help you heal.

37:14.550 --> 37:16.880
Then, let's team up

37:16.880 --> 37:18.340
and have an awesome fight.

37:18.480 --> 37:20.550
What a good idea.

37:21.360 --> 37:22.220
Sect Leader Mo,

37:22.560 --> 37:24.260
I'll leave these guys to you.

37:30.800 --> 37:31.320
Come on.

39:48.760 --> 39:50.560
Young lady, you're not half bad.

39:50.880 --> 39:52.680
You actually managed to survive

39:52.760 --> 39:54.290
my Waterfall Sword Strike.

39:55.280 --> 39:56.320
But I still advise you

39:56.320 --> 39:57.440
to simply retreat.

39:57.840 --> 39:59.360
Wudang Sect
is known for its defensive skills.

39:59.360 --> 40:00.590
If I am to leave Tianzheng unattended

40:00.590 --> 40:02.800
and to end your lives one by one,

40:03.000 --> 40:04.660
it won't be quite easy indeed.

40:04.760 --> 40:06.480
But I suggest you never think of

40:06.480 --> 40:08.890
breaking in and attacking us,

40:09.000 --> 40:10.860
if you aren't as good as Crazy Yan.

40:14.070 --> 40:15.930
We are certainly no match for you.

40:16.630 --> 40:17.630
Nonetheless,

40:19.000 --> 40:20.840
you two have both been poisoned.

40:26.530 --> 40:28.000
It's the Energy Suppressing Powder?

40:28.000 --> 40:28.800
That's right.

40:29.070 --> 40:31.150
It's exactly
Wu Kuyu's Energy Suppressing Powder.

40:31.150 --> 40:35.350
I'm afraid you'll find it difficult
to pool the internal energy inside you.

40:35.470 --> 40:37.200
This devious little trick

40:37.780 --> 40:39.700
can hardly harm me and...

40:46.510 --> 40:47.030
Master!

40:47.160 --> 40:47.850
Tianzheng!

40:55.590 --> 40:56.590
What is going on?

40:57.510 --> 40:58.590
It's the sutra.

41:04.880 --> 41:07.110
Master Tianzheng,
when you grabbed the Mind Sutra,

41:07.110 --> 41:09.630
you killed the poisonous bugs
with your Finger of Vicissitudes, right?

41:09.630 --> 41:12.150
Those were Radiant Algae Bugs.

41:12.710 --> 41:14.880
When you killed them
with your Finger of Vicissitudes,

41:14.880 --> 41:17.540
they became algae powder
attaching to the book,

41:17.590 --> 41:20.150
and was later transferred to your hand,
Master.

41:20.150 --> 41:22.230
When you used your Finger of Vicissitudes
to heal your wounds,

41:22.230 --> 41:24.370
they were revived
by the miraculous power in it,

41:24.370 --> 41:27.570
transformed back into bugs,
and then went into your body.

41:27.760 --> 41:30.000
As Master Taichan helped you heal,

41:30.000 --> 41:31.670
the bugs naturally moved

41:31.670 --> 41:33.270
into Master Taichan's body.

41:33.590 --> 41:36.150
We sacrificed so many lives
in the previous attacks

41:36.150 --> 41:37.880
just to make you two
use your inner energy,

41:37.880 --> 41:39.760
so that the bugs could be activated.

41:39.760 --> 41:43.090
If it hadn't been for
the old monk's Finger of Vicissitudes,

41:44.510 --> 41:47.040
these bugs wouldn't have
kicked into effect.

41:49.630 --> 41:50.960
You despicable people!

41:51.480 --> 41:54.760
It turns out you knew
I'd come here in the first place.

41:55.150 --> 41:57.710
You did all that stuff just to trap me.

41:59.360 --> 42:01.550
Amitabha.

42:01.700 --> 42:03.330
Father, Mother!

42:17.240 --> 42:18.150
The Power Gang?

42:20.090 --> 42:20.740
Qiushui!

42:27.960 --> 42:28.590
Qiushui!
